OL,3,GNEWSATwo men charged after police
OL,4,Aattacked in Holylands over Halloween
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been charged after police
OL,7,Fwere attacked in the Holylands in
OL,8,FBelfast on Halloween night.
OL,10,FIt happened in Agincourt Avenue about
OL,11,F19:40 BST on Saturday, during which a
OL,12,Fpolice vehicle was repeatedly kicked
OL,13,Fand glass bottles were thrown towards
OL,14,Fofficers.
OL,16,FA 19-year-old man has been charged with
OL,17,Fthree counts of assault on police,
OL,18,Friotous behaviour, resisting police,
OL,19,Fobstructing police and three counts of
OL,20,Fattempted criminal damage.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
